            "id": "https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45582",
            "content_html": "<p dir=\"auto\">A <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;form&gt;</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">FormData</code> is often viewed as a key-value map, including methods common to iterable objects:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/FormData/entries\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/FormData/entries</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/FormData/keys\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/FormData/keys</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/FormData/values\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/FormData/values</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Unlike iterable objects such as <code class=\"notranslate\">Map</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">FormData</code> can have multiple key-value pairs with the same key (this follows from the fact that a <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;form&gt;</code> can have multiple elements with the same name). A naive iteration over a <code class=\"notranslate\">FormData</code> with the assumption of the keys being unique can result in bugs. So it would be helpful if these methods explicitly call out that keys are not necessarily unique; and that the <code class=\"notranslate\">get</code> or <code class=\"notranslate\">getAll</code> method of <code class=\"notranslate\">FormData</code> should be used depending on the intended use case.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The top-level documentation does not make it obvious either: <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/FormData/FormData\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/FormData/FormData</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">If you want to verify manually, here is an example:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-text-html-basic notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"&lt;form id=&quot;dupeform&quot;&gt;\n &lt;input name=&quot;dupekey&quot; value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;\n &lt;input name=&quot;dupekey&quot; value=&quot;2&quot;&gt;\n&lt;/form&gt;\n&lt;script&gt;\nlet fd = new FormData(document.getElementById(&quot;dupeform&quot;));\nconsole.log(Array.from(fd.keys())); // [&quot;dupekey&quot;, &quot;dupekey&quot;]\nconsole.log(Array.from(fd.entries())); // [[&quot;dupekey&quot;, &quot;1&quot;], [&quot;dupekey&quot;, &quot;2&quot;]]\nconsole.log(Array.from(fd.values())); // [&quot;1&quot;, &quot;2&quot;]\n\n// Example of potential bug: lost a value\nconsole.log(new Map(fd)); // Map with one entry, &quot;dupekey&quot; with value &quot;2&quot;; lost&quot;1&quot;.\n&lt;/script&gt;\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><span class=\"pl-kos\">&lt;</span><span class=\"pl-ent\">form</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">id</span>=\"<span class=\"pl-s\">dupeform</span>\"<span class=\"pl-kos\">&gt;</span>\n <span class=\"pl-kos\">&lt;</span><span class=\"pl-ent\">input</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">name</span>=\"<span class=\"pl-s\">dupekey</span>\" <span class=\"pl-c1\">value</span>=\"<span class=\"pl-s\">1</span>\"<span class=\"pl-kos\">&gt;</span>\n <span class=\"pl-kos\">&lt;</span><span class=\"pl-ent\">input</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">name</span>=\"<span class=\"pl-s\">dupekey</span>\" <span class=\"pl-c1\">value</span>=\"<span class=\"pl-s\">2</span>\"<span class=\"pl-kos\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"pl-kos\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"pl-ent\">form</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"pl-kos\">&lt;</span><span class=\"pl-ent\">script</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"pl-k\">let</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">fd</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">new</span> <span class=\"pl-v\">FormData</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-smi\">document</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">.</span><span class=\"pl-en\">getElementById</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-s\">\"dupeform\"</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span>\n<span class=\"pl-smi\">console</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">.</span><span class=\"pl-en\">log</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-v\">Array</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">.</span><span class=\"pl-en\">from</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-s1\">fd</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">.</span><span class=\"pl-en\">keys</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span> <span class=\"pl-c\">// [\"dupekey\", \"dupekey\"]</span>\n<span class=\"pl-smi\">console</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">.</span><span class=\"pl-en\">log</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-v\">Array</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">.</span><span class=\"pl-en\">from</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-s1\">fd</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">.</span><span class=\"pl-en\">entries</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span> <span class=\"pl-c\">// [[\"dupekey\", \"1\"], [\"dupekey\", \"2\"]]</span>\n<span class=\"pl-smi\">console</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">.</span><span class=\"pl-en\">log</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-v\">Array</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">.</span><span class=\"pl-en\">from</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-s1\">fd</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">.</span><span class=\"pl-en\">values</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span> <span class=\"pl-c\">// [\"1\", \"2\"]</span>\n\n<span class=\"pl-c\">// Example of potential bug: lost a value</span>\n<span class=\"pl-smi\">console</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">.</span><span class=\"pl-en\">log</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-k\">new</span> <span class=\"pl-v\">Map</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-s1\">fd</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span> <span class=\"pl-c\">// Map with one entry, \"dupekey\" with value \"2\"; lost\"1\".</span>\n<span class=\"pl-kos\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"pl-ent\">script</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">&gt;</span></pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This behavior is not new, the wpt test verifying the behavior across browsers was checked in 10 years ago: <a class=\"commit-link\" data-hovercard-type=\"commit\" data-hovercard-url=\"https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/commit/f8fa38984dbd1527b2fa292b2527c39c1605ba27/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/commit/f8fa38984dbd1527b2fa292b2527c39c1605ba27\">web-platform-tests/wpt@<tt>f8fa389</tt></a> (test has moved since then, but is still here: <a href=\"https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/blame/7926f3ca1cd9f7f1df88db0bb0cee14f278a559b/xhr/formdata/foreach.any.js\">https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/blame/7926f3ca1cd9f7f1df88db0bb0cee14f278a559b/xhr/formdata/foreach.any.js</a> )</p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45582",
            "title": "[xhr] FormData and its iterable methods (keys, entries, values) should mention possibility of duplicate keys",
